    <string name="help_dialog_title">3D Path Following Controls</string>
    <string name="help_dialog_message" formatted="false">🧭 Camera Gestures:\n• Vertical Sweep (1 Finger): Adjusts camera tilt (0° to 85°)\n• Horizontal Sweep (1 Finger): Rotates camera heading orbit\n• Pinch (2 Fingers): Zooms camera in / out\n\n⚡ Speed &amp; Navigation:\n• Long Press &amp; Hold: 2x Boost (at 0.5s) → 5x Warp Speed (at 2s)\n• Double-Tap &amp; Hold Right: +5x Fast-Forward\n• Double-Tap &amp; Hold Left: -5x Rewind\n• Quick Double-Tap: Skip +/- 10% along path\n• Speed Chips (0.5x - 5x): Instant preset selection\n\n🎛️ Control Panel:\n• Swipe Up / Down or Tap Header: Expand / collapse settings panel\n• Idle Auto-Fade: Panel fades to transparent after 3.5s of inactivity</string>
